{"words": [{"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "Then"}, {"text": "قَسَتْ", "translation": "hardened"}, {"text": "قُلُوبُكُم", "translation": "your hearts"}, {"text": "مِّنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "فَهِىَ", "translation": "so they"}, {"text": "كَٱلْحِجَارَةِ", "translation": "(became) like [the] stones"}, {"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "أَشَدُّ", "translation": "stronger"}, {"text": "قَسْوَةًۭ ۚ", "translation": "(in) hardness"}, {"text": "وَإِنَّ", "translation": "And indeed"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱلْحِجَارَةِ", "translation": "the stones"}, {"text": "لَمَا", "translation": "certainly (there are some) which"}, {"text": "يَتَفَجَّرُ", "translation": "gush forth"}, {"text": "مِنْهُ", "translation": "from it"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ۚ", "translation": "[the] rivers"}, {"text": "وَإِنَّ", "translation": "and indeed"}, {"text": "مِنْهَا", "translation": "from them"}, {"text": "لَمَا", "translation": "certainly (there are some) which"}, {"text": "يَشَّقَّقُ", "translation": "split"}, {"text": "فَيَخْرُجُ", "translation": "so comes out"}, {"text": "مِنْهُ", "translation": "from it"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَآءُ ۚ", "translation": "[the] water"}, {"text": "وَإِنَّ", "translation": "and indeed"}, {"text": "مِنْهَا", "translation": "from them"}, {"text": "لَمَا", "translation": "certainly (there are some) which"}, {"text": "يَهْبِطُ", "translation": "fall down"}, {"text": "مِنْ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "خَشْيَةِ", "translation": "fear"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۗ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "(is) Allah"}, {"text": "بِغَـٰفِلٍ", "translation": "unaware"}, {"text": "عَمَّا", "translation": "of what"}, {"text": "تَعْمَلُونَ", "translation": "you do"}], "sahih": "Then your hearts became hardened after that, being like stones or even harder. For indeed, there are stones from which rivers burst forth, and there are some of them that split open and water comes out, and there are some of them that fall down for fear of Allāh. And Allāh is not unaware of what you do."}